From: Sahil Bakshi <sahilbakshi2001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:14:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] devices: add device id for Qualcomm Atheros IPQ9574

This is the merged upstream iwinfo PR #51, pinned locally because the
OpenWrt base snapshot uses libiwinfo commit 66bdd1a071895d91babc9b9228bb84626bbce226,
which predates the merge.

Signed-off-by: Sahil Bakshi <sahilbakshi2001@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Robert Marko <robimarko@gmail.com>
---
 devices.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/devices.txt
+++ b/devices.txt
@@ -262,6 +262,7 @@
 "qcom,ipq4019-wifi"     0      0  "Qualcomm Atheros" "IPQ4019"
 "qcom,ipq5018-wifi"     0      0  "Qualcomm Atheros" "IPQ5018"
 "qcom,ipq6018-wifi"     0      0  "Qualcomm Atheros" "IPQ6018"
 "qcom,ipq8074-wifi"     0      0  "Qualcomm Atheros" "IPQ8074"
+"qcom,ipq9574-wifi"     0      0  "Qualcomm Atheros" "IPQ9574"
 "qcom,qcn6122-wifi"     0      0  "Qualcomm Atheros" "QCN6102/QCN6122"
 "mediatek,mt7622-wmac"  0      0  "MediaTek" "MT7622"
